<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00132/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一件黑色卫衣，当被放置在椅背上时会缓慢在椅背上堆叠新的衣服，新产生的个体不具有异常性质。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-101员工Fred的宿舍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放在Site-CN-101的低价值物品保险柜。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>你确定不是仅仅因为你懒而已？——GuAo</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00132" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00132" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00132-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-am-guao" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5948673); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5948673&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608344751" alt="I am GuAo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5948673)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/i-am-guao" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5948673); return false;">I am GuAo</a></span></p>
