<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>由██国产的一部华█手机。当有非该国国籍的人手持该项目，并以夸张的表情和语气说出夸赞有关该国的话时，该项目会变成一部iP█one手机。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一名俄罗斯籍男子手中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存于Site-CN-57中的一个低危异常储存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我一直支持国产！嘿！S█ri，我的█文好吗？——Fula████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00204" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00204-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608344751" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;">Dr Fishbone</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589607754 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 May 2020 05:42</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00450/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一台手机，型号未知，系统未知，当有人在使用它超过2小时之后，眼睛会剧烈疼痛，并且此现象会持续20秒，之后使用者的视力会成为5.0，并且永远不会改变。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██省██市██街<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>魏██研究员的抽屉里<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>谁██的能告诉我，为啥我视力是5.2现在却成了5.0了？！姓魏的我要杀了你啊！<br />
-██博士</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00450" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00450" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00450-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sertay" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6605732); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6605732&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608344751" alt="sertay" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6605732)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sertay" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6605732); return false;">sertay</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1603343321 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Oct 2020 05:08</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00441/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只█技牌无线鼠标，当持有者将其放入书包尝试前往图书馆时，该鼠标有8█%的概率会瞬间移动至持有者寝室的桌面上并使持有者产生“我又忘了带鼠标”的错觉。该批次产品均有异常现象。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>研究员ENC的寝室<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被研究员ENC在寝室使用<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>当我连续███次去图书馆发现没带鼠标，我就知道这玩意不对劲了——研究员ENC</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00441" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00441" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00441-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6273721&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608344751" alt="EdwardNewtChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6273721)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/edwardnewtchen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6273721); return false;">EdwardNewtChen</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1602464155 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">12 Oct 2020 00:55</span></p>
